TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}Sonunda {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Balık Turnuvası{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} günü geldi!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Bugün biraz balık tutacağım, sonra biraz
daha! {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!

FR:
{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}C'est pour aujourd'hui ou pour
demain, ce tournoi de pêche ?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Je vais leur en mettre plein la vue,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
hé hé !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Today's the big {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I'm just going to warn you though—{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
don't get in my way, all right?!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Hoy es el gran Torneo de Pesca!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Te aviso ya:{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} no tienes nada que
hacer contra mí.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Luego no me vengas con lloriqueos{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oggi si tiene il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}torneo di pesca{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ti avverto:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} non provare a mettermi
i bastoni tra le ruote!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Today is the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Well,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} even though we both know I'm
gonna win,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} you shouldn't give up!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡El Torneo de Pesca es hoy!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡Y aunque ya sepamos quién ganará,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
te puedes divertir pescando un rato!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oggi c'è il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}torneo di pesca{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Beh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} anche se sappiamo tutti e due
che vincerò io,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} dovresti provarci!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bugün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Balık Turnuvası{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Eh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ikimiz de benim kazanacağımı
biliyoruz ama{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} sen yine de pes etme!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}has just begun!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I'm not going to panic.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm just
gonna keep hauling in fish!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Look out! I'm goin' for the gold!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡El Torneo de Pesca ha comenzado!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Pero no hay que ponerse nerviosos.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Solo hay que pescar y seguir
pescando.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}¡Atentos todos!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¡Voy a por el oro!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Il torneo di pesca è cominciato!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Niente panico.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Devo solo continuare
a pescare alla grande come sempre!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}E il gradino più alto del podio...
sarà mio!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}has just begun,
but {{TAG:0003:0021:}}I'm already off to a great start!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}The fish are really biting today!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Don't get mad at me if there aren't
any fish left for you to catch 'cause
I already took 'em all!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
El Torneo de Pesca no ha hecho
más que comenzar,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}pero creo que
he empezado bien.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Los peces no paran de picar!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}No te enfades si no dejo ninguno.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} 
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Balık Turnuvası {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}daha yeni başladı
ama{{TAG:0003:0021:}} ben şimdiden şahane gidiyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugün balıklar fena vuruyor!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Hepsini ben tuttum diye sana balık
kalmazsa kızma!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Cómo va la pesca?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}No vas
a ganar nada con cuatro jureles
de poca monta.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}A lo mejor me compadezco y te
dejo algún pescado grandote.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¡O a lo mejor no!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

Cuando echas el anzuelo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¿te fijas bien en la dirección
que lleva el agua?
¿Y observas también {{TAG:0003:0015:}}hacia dónde
apunta la sombra del pez?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡Que no se diga que no comparto
mi sabiduría con los principiantes!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Das {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Angelturnier {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}ist bald vorbei!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Bist du sicher, dass du hier mit mir
reden solltest statt zu angeln?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bwa ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Il torneo di pesca sta per terminare!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Io so che vincerò. Tu intanto non
gettare la spugna! {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}is almost over!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Sure you don't wanna catch one last
big fish before it's over?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Il torneo di pesca è quasi finito!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Sicur{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} di non voler fare un ultimo
tentativo?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}is over!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Now we gotta wait for the
awards ceremony!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Of course, I'll be the one standing
in the center of the podium, but you
can still enjoy it!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Se acabó.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} ¡Adiós Torneo de Pesca!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Bueno,{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}} ahora falta la ceremonia
de entrega de premios.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Cuando me veas subir a lo más alto
del podio,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¡saluda!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Il torneo di pesca è finito!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Ora bisogna aspettare la cerimonia
di premiazione!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Tanto lo sanno tutti che io salirò
sul gradino più alto. Una ragione
in più per esserci!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Das {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Angelturnier {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}ist vorbei!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Jetzt muss ich nur noch auf meinen
Preis warten!
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Eigentlich würde ich neben dem
ersten Platz auch noch den zweiten
und dritten verdienen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bwa ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Balık Turnuvası {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}bitti!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Şimdi ödül törenini bekleyeceğiz!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Tabii
