EN:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}is all over!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I'm looking forward to the awards
