DE:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Vorbei ist es, das {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Angelturnier{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mal gespannt, wer außer mir noch
gewonnen hat...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡Unas veces se gana y otras se
pierde!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Y esta vez me has ganado.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}La próxima vez lo pienso dar todo,{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}¡ya verás,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0029:}}I didn't think I'd lose to you!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Guess I let my guard down!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I'm not gonna lose next time!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0029:}}No esperaba que me ganaras.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
¡Me he confiado demasiado!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡La próxima vez,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} verás!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0029:}}Non mi aspettavo di perdere contro
di te!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Stavolta ho fatto cilecca!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ma la prossima volta... vedrai!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0029:}}Sana yenileceğimi düşünmemiştim!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Demek gardımı düşürmüşüm!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Bir dahaki sefere kaybetmem!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Hmmm. This pains me to admit, but
you won this round against me!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Congratulations, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Mi costa fatica ammetterlo,
ma stavolta mi hai stracciato!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Congratulazioni, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

TRANSLATION:
