yanlışlıkla gerçek balıkçılık gücümü
salıvermişim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Heh heh! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}I won!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It's only natural, 'cause in my case,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
even if I don't do anything, the fish
just jump into my arms!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Don't hate me for it!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

So{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}} you didn't get an award?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Were you running around so much
that you scared the fish away?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Te has quedado sin premio?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¿Con tanto dar vueltas has
