{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
La prossima volta vieni a vederla,
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}così puoi ammirarmi col mio trofeo,
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
