Die Preisverleihung für das
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Angelturnier {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}ist schon vorbei!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}It was a peaceful yet fierce
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}It's a tough balance. If you carry on
too much,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} the fish'll all swim away!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Si te emocionas demasiado,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} acabas
